  "description": "Reid Impact | 20 inch kids' mountain bike\nBuilt for young adventurers, the Reid Impact is a 20\" kids' mountain bike designed to make exploring more fun. With a durable steel frame, 7-speed Shimano gearing and reliable V brakes, it's a versatile choice for children ready to discover more on two wheels.\nThe 7-speed Shimano drivetrain gives young riders a range of gears to tackle different terrain, from neighbourhood streets and park paths to more adventurous family rides. Powerful V brakes provide reliable stopping power and control, helping riders build confidence as their skills develop.\nWith its sleek design and sturdy construction, the Impact is built for everyday riding and outdoor adventures. Whether they're cruising around the neighbourhood, exploring the local park or heading out with the family, it's ready for wherever the next ride takes them.\nWho is the Impact for?\nThe Reid Impact 20\" Kids' Mountain Bike is ideal for:\n\nYoung riders ready for a 20\" kids' mountain bike\nChildren developing confidence on different types of terrain\nRiders looking for the versatility of 7-speed gearing\nKids exploring neighbourhoods, parks and local trails\nParents looking for a durable and affordable kids' MTB\nEveryday adventures and family bike rides\n\nFind the right fit\nChoosing the right bike size helps your child ride comfortably, confidently and safely. Use our Kids' Bike Size Guide by clicking the tab above to find the right Reid bike based on your child's height and age.",
